10:02:45 settled
🟠 reports in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps failing its liveness check (connection refused), so the kubelet keeps restarting it, likely because its containers are not ready when liveness gives up. Liveness gives reports 25s (5s delay + 2 × 10s), and reports was not ready when each kill came. Its last run lasted 27 seconds; three restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix in: deployment/reports → container app → livenessProbe (initialDelaySeconds 5, periodSeconds 10, failureThreshold 2). To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs reports-c87cd316-a -c app -n shop --previous
